OL,6, GRIEF AND RELIEF OVER CHOICEV "/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, Manchester's dreams have been shattered
OL,9, in Monte Carlo as Olympic chiefs sent
OL,10, Australia into raptures by awarding the
OL,11, 2000 Games to Sydney.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe team were left crestfallen by the
OL,14,FInternational Olympic Committee's
OL,15,Fdecision to send the Millenium Games to
OL,16,Fthe southern hemisphere.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThere was widespread relief that the
OL,19,Fgames had not been granted to Peking.
