OL,6, SEARCH FOR IRA GUN GANG        R (/q
OL,7,                                R ,'!$#!
OL,8, A search is underway on both sides of
OL,9, the Irish border for an IRA gang who
OL,10, tried to shoot down an Army helicopter
OL,11, and fought a gun battle with troops.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FLarge areas of the border in south
OL,14,FArmagh were sealed off after the attack
OL,15,Fat Crossmaglen.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FThe gunmen attacked the helicopter as
OL,18,Fit left a base then ran into a patrol
OL,19,Fof soldiers who opened fire.
