OL,6, YELTSIN CALLS EARLY ELECTIONV "/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, Russian President Boris Yeltsin has
OL,9, called presidential elections for June
OL,10, 12, two years ahead of schedule.
OL,12,FThe decree was made public by his
OL,13,Foffice three years to the day after he
OL,14,Fwas elected for what was to be a
OL,15,Ffive-year term.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FMr Yeltsin said he would stand for a
OL,18,Fthird term in the polls although it had
OL,19,F"turned out inconveniently".
